#. Unlock_Cheat.Languages.UI.NOTIFICATIONS.BUILDING_MELT_WARNING.NAME
msgctxt "Unlock_Cheat.Languages.UI.NOTIFICATIONS.BUILDING_MELT_WARNING.NAME"
msgid "即将融化"
msgstr "Melting Soon"

#. Unlock_Cheat.Languages.UI.NOTIFICATIONS.BUILDING_MELT_WARNING.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "Unlock_Cheat.Languages.UI.NOTIFICATIONS.BUILDING_MELT_WARNING.TOOLTIP"
msgid "以下建筑已超过材料熔点，将在30秒宽限期后融化。冷却至熔点以下、禁用建筑或点击豁免可取消融化:"
msgstr "The following buildings have exceeded their materials' melting point and will melt after a 30s grace period. Cool them below melting point, disable them, or use the Exempt button to cancel the melt:"

#. Unlock_Cheat.Languages.UI.USERMENUACTIONS.MELT_EXEMPT.NAME
msgctxt "Unlock_Cheat.Languages.UI.USERMENUACTIONS.MELT_EXEMPT.NAME"
msgid "豁免融化"
msgstr "Exempt from Melting"

#. Unlock_Cheat.Languages.UI.USERMENUACTIONS.MELT_EXEMPT.NAME_OFF
msgctxt "Unlock_Cheat.Languages.UI.USERMENUACTIONS.MELT_EXEMPT.NAME_OFF"
msgid "取消豁免"
msgstr "Cancel Exemption"

#. Unlock_Cheat.Languages.UI.USERMENUACTIONS.MELT_EXEMPT.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "Unlock_Cheat.Languages.UI.USERMENUACTIONS.MELT_EXEMPT.TOOLTIP"
msgid "该建筑将被豁免，不再融化（随存档保存）"
msgstr "This building will no longer melt (saved with the game)"

#. Unlock_Cheat.Languages.UI.USERMENUACTIONS.MELT_EXEMPT.TOOLTIP_OFF
msgctxt "Unlock_Cheat.Languages.UI.USERMENUACTIONS.MELT_EXEMPT.TOOLTIP_OFF"
msgid "取消豁免：若温度仍超过熔点，将重新进入30秒融化宽限期"
msgstr "Cancel exemption: if still above the melting point, the building re-enters the 30s melting grace period"
